/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Traditional identity verification and certification processes in barangay offices often lead to delays and inefficiencies. To address this, our research focuses on developing a web-based barangay system that integrates facial recognition for secure and efficient authentication. By automating identity verification, the system enhances security, reduces processing time, and improves administrative efficiency. This digital transformation ensures a more accessible, reliable, and user-friendly service for both residents and barangay officials.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
