345 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The study successfully developed VerifyID, an online barangay system integrating facial recognition for identity authentication and digital certificate management. The system was evaluated based on ISO/IEC 25010 quality metrics, emphasizing functional suitability, efficiency, security, usability, and compatibility. Findings revealed that 98.9% of users confirmed accurate identity verification, while 97.8% found the system effective in streamlining certificate requests. Additionally, 96.7% of respondents approved its multi-platform functionality, ensuring accessibility across devices. The CNN model achieved a perfect accuracy of 1.000, validating its highly reliable facial recognition capabilities. The study concluded that VerifyID enhances barangay service efficiency, reduces manual verification processes, and improves security. While challenges such as accessibility for non-tech-savvy users and security enhancements were identified, proposed future improvements include stronger encryption, real-time feedback mechanisms, and mobile application development to further optimize user experience and system reliability.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
